Add `selectedProvider: ByokProvider` to `ByokUiState` (default `AZURE`).
Add `needsEndpoint: Boolean` and `needsResourceName: Boolean` to `ByokUiState`.
Add `selectedProvider: String` to `ByokDebugSnapshot`.

